      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your reflection on finding dignity in stepping away highlights a profound moment of compassion for yourself rather than just community preservation. Recognizing when to prioritize your own well-being over witnessing decay is an act of self-respect, not just cowardice. It is entirely acceptable to choose peace at the cost of watching it burn rather than enduring the loneliness of a final, painful vigil.",
